 **TOPIC: Malware Analysis**

Process of malware analysis: Malware analysis takes place when malware comes inside a system.
1) Identify the affected system
2) Isolate the affected system
3) Shutdown the network (turning off the switch of the network if necessary)
4) Finding malware
5) Static and Dynamic malware analysis 
6) Delete the malware
7) Backdoor checking
8) If copy exists then Delete the copies of malware 
9) Backup and recovery of data 
10) Reporting
